<title>ITALY: Cofide -documents taken in investigation.</title>
<headline>Cofide -documents taken in investigation.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cofide, the holding company of the De Benedetti family, said magistrates had ordered Italian finance police to take company documents relating to the group's dealing with the failed group Sasea.</p>
<p>In a Cofide statement, it said that documents had been taken relating to dealings between the Cofide and Sasea, the finance group of Florio Fiorini.</p>
<p>-- Milan newsroom +392 66129502</p>
</text>
